From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] websocket: the WebSocket protocol component (6010)

websocket.dll: client and server handles, handshakes, framing with masking,
fragments, ping/pong and close, the action queue (N-WEBSOCKET).
